1.1 CONSTANT WINDOW PROBLEMS: 
  Basic problem :-
      arr = list(map(int,input().split()))
      k = int(input())
      left = 0
      right = k-1
      Sum = sum(arr[0:k])
      maxSum = Sum
      n=len(arr)
      while(right<n-1):
          Sum-=arr[left]
          left+=1
          right+=1
          Sum+=arr[right]
          maxSum = max(maxSum, Sum)
      print(maxSum)
